                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Gummeré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-25"><hi rendition="#italic">June 25,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay congratulates Mr. Gummeré and commends his energetic and successful work
                    in bringing about the release of Mr. Perdicaris.)</p>
            </div>
